survive misuse of atomic power. From Princeton, New Jersey, the Emergency

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:11.610
Committee of Atomic Scientists, headed by Dr. Einstein, has issued an urgent appeal

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:16.580
for funds with which to educate the public. We scientists who released this

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:24.940
immense power have overwhelming responsibility in this world, life, and

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:29.980
death struggle to harness atom. We ask your help in this faith.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:48.500
moment as signs that we scientists do not stand alone agree of scientists today is to bring home

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:55.670
to the public a realization of the magnitude of an atomic bomb explosion and the fact that this

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:59.750
sudden destruction can be delivered anywhere on earth by a single plane

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:06.400
that a bomb could be brought into a seaport by a ship and detonated by radio.

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:17.370
Ignisant of the potential threat to humanity and the unrestricted use of atomic power,

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:21.620
Dr. Bush and Dr. Conant accepted appointments to a State Department committee

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:23.940
headed by Undersecretary Dean Atchison.

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:29.980
Out of the work of this group and David E. Lillianthold,

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:35.040
board of consultants came the report upon which was based the u.s plan for international control

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:43.730
which bernard baruch proposed to the united nations atomic energy commission the american

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:49.350
position as expressed by baruch and his advisors has received overwhelming support from a majority

00:16:49.350 --> 00:16:57.710
of the nations the search of science for the absolute weapon has reached fruition in this

00:16:57.710 --> 00:16:58.010
country.

00:17:00.730 --> 00:17:07.050
But we stand ready to destroy this instrument, to lift it from death to life,

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:13.860
if the world will join in an effective and working system.

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:17.180
Let us not deceive ourselves.

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:22.540
We must elect world peace or world destruction.

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:29.960
Today, the whole world fears the ultimate devastation.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:34.840
station which a war of atomic weapons could bring. And the United States is prepared to

00:17:34.840 --> 00:17:41.450
cooperate fully in eliminating, by world agreement and for all time, the nightmare of atomic war.
